canvas                  Graphics device for drawing to a HTML canvas
                        element
canvas_cache            Interact with the 'OffscreenCanvas' cache
canvas_install          Use the webR canvas graphics device
eval_js                 Evaluate JavaScript code
eval_r                  Evaluate the provided R code, call, or
                        expression for webR
global_prompt_install   Install a global handler to automatically
                        download missing packages
install                 Install one or more packages from a webR binary
                        package repo
library_shim            Install missing packages from the default webR
                        binary repo
mount                   Mount an Emscripten filesystem object
pager_install           Generate an output message when file is
                        displayed with the pager
shim_install            Shim functions from base R
syncfs                  Synchronise the Emscripten virtual filesystem
test_package            Test an installed R package by running the
                        package examples and tests
viewer_install          Generate an output message when a URL is
                        browsed to
YEAR: 2023
